WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.339 --> 00:00:02.506
- You only live once so...

00:00:04.359 --> 00:00:05.898
- Today we're going to
play do you know your

00:00:05.898 --> 00:00:07.617
favorite artist's real name?

00:00:07.617 --> 00:00:09.860
The sudden death pie to the face quiz.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.702
I'm going to give each
person 10 seconds to answer.

00:00:12.702 --> 00:00:15.700
If they get it right, they
can eat this delicious pie.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.877
If they get it wrong, they've got to slam

00:00:17.877 --> 00:00:19.825
their face into this pie.

00:00:19.825 --> 00:00:22.325
(tense music)

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.499
- I don't really like pies but I do think

00:00:26.499 --> 00:00:28.577
that I'm a master of trivia.

00:00:28.577 --> 00:00:30.252
- [Voiceover] His stage name is Bono.

00:00:30.252 --> 00:00:33.593
Is his real name John
O'Dwyer or Paul Hewson?

00:00:33.593 --> 00:00:34.426
- Oh man.

00:00:37.347 --> 00:00:40.694
Is it John O'Dwyer,
sounds very Irish to me,

00:00:40.694 --> 00:00:42.237
the O in there.

00:00:42.237 --> 00:00:45.835
So I'm going to go with John O'Dwyer.

00:00:45.835 --> 00:00:47.710
- [Voiceover] Wrong.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:48.543
- Aw, man.

00:00:54.909 --> 00:00:57.217
- [Voiceover] His stage
name is The Weeknd.

00:00:57.217 --> 00:01:00.125
Is his real name Gabriel Rodriguez-Lopez

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:01.763
or Abel Tesfaye?

00:01:01.763 --> 00:01:05.273
- Abel Tesfaye because
he dates Bella Hadid

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:07.420
who I'm in love with.

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.686
I get to keep this pie.

00:01:09.686 --> 00:01:10.519
Maybe.

00:01:12.529 --> 00:01:13.440
- [Voiceover] Correct.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.683
- Yes!

00:01:14.683 --> 00:01:16.672
- I'm like suddenly so nervous and tense.

00:01:16.672 --> 00:01:18.750
My mouth is dry.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.497
- [Voiceover] Her stage name is Rihanna.

00:01:20.497 --> 00:01:23.965
Is her real name Robyn
Fenty or Anna Rebele?

00:01:23.965 --> 00:01:25.652
- There's no way that Rihanna's last name

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:28.089
is Rebele and she didn't make that part

00:01:28.089 --> 00:01:29.122
of her stage name.

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:30.927
Rebele is too cool of a name.

00:01:30.927 --> 00:01:32.454
She'd just be like,
"Yo, my name is Rebel."

00:01:32.454 --> 00:01:33.832
Or like Lil' Rebel, that
would be my rap name.

00:01:33.832 --> 00:01:36.138
- [Voiceover] Correct.

00:01:36.138 --> 00:01:38.825
- Does that mean I don't have
to smash a pie in my face?

00:01:38.825 --> 00:01:40.097
I get to eat the pie.

00:01:40.097 --> 00:01:41.578
- [Voiceover] The pie is yours.

00:01:41.578 --> 00:01:44.067
- I kind of want to smash
it in my face anyway.

00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:45.777
I've never smashed a pie in my face.

00:01:45.777 --> 00:01:46.864
Is that okay?

00:01:46.864 --> 00:01:48.531
I love you, Rihanna.

00:01:49.415 --> 00:01:52.089
(rock music)

00:01:52.089 --> 00:01:53.075
That was good.

00:01:53.075 --> 00:01:55.169
- I know musicians' names
because I like the realness.

00:01:55.169 --> 00:01:56.511
I like the truth.

00:01:56.511 --> 00:01:58.353
- [Voiceover] Her stage
name is Taylor Swift.

00:01:58.353 --> 00:02:02.436
Is her real name Taylor
Swift or Taylor Callahan?

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:06.876
(tense music)

00:02:06.876 --> 00:02:08.543
- It's Taylor Swift.

00:02:11.561 --> 00:02:12.394
Right?

00:02:12.394 --> 00:02:15.227
- [Voiceover] Final answer?
- Yeah, that's Taylor Swift.

00:02:15.227 --> 00:02:16.451
- [Voiceover] Correct.

00:02:16.451 --> 00:02:17.284
- Cool.

00:02:18.281 --> 00:02:19.974
- (beeps) I'm scared.

00:02:19.974 --> 00:02:20.985
Okay, I'm ready.

00:02:20.985 --> 00:02:23.200
(laughs)

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.483
- [Voiceover] His stage
name is Kendrick Lamar.

00:02:25.483 --> 00:02:29.650
Is his real name Kendrick
Duckworth or Lamar Kendall?

00:02:31.044 --> 00:02:34.426
- Oh man, Duckworth, I
don't know that I know

00:02:34.426 --> 00:02:36.345
anybody with the last name Duckworth.

00:02:36.345 --> 00:02:39.929
So, I'm thinking that I'm going to go with

00:02:39.929 --> 00:02:41.179
the second one.

00:02:42.037 --> 00:02:43.308
- [Voiceover] Wrong.

00:02:43.308 --> 00:02:44.872
(laughs)

00:02:44.872 --> 00:02:46.333
- What? What?

00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:48.149
(laughs)

00:02:48.149 --> 00:02:48.982
Duckworth?

00:02:50.617 --> 00:02:52.169
This is (beeps) up.

00:02:52.169 --> 00:02:55.078
This is so (beeps) up.

00:02:55.078 --> 00:02:57.328
(laughing)

00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:05.607
It's inside my nose.

00:03:05.607 --> 00:03:06.856
- If I were a singer, I'd probably go

00:03:06.856 --> 00:03:08.212
with a fake name too.

00:03:08.212 --> 00:03:10.295
I'd be like, "Andromeda."

00:03:12.676 --> 00:03:14.182
- [Voiceover] Andromeda Cornfeld.

00:03:14.182 --> 00:03:16.274
- Andromeda Cornfeld, yeah,
I'd keep the Cornfeld.

00:03:16.274 --> 00:03:17.693
I'd keep the Jewish part of my name

00:03:17.693 --> 00:03:21.276
but change Zach, I'd
be Andromeda Cornfeld.

00:03:22.819 --> 00:03:23.652
(creaking)

